    {
      "id": "5308499d-1d5f-448c-b2d4-9edf91280663",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e compare mentalmente com primer piso.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "26aeea49-d72e-4c90-95a0-cf66787356b4",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Segundo piso</strong> localiza o andar que vem logo depois do primeiro.</p><p>A lógica continua a mesma: o ordinal mostra a ordem e <strong>piso</strong> diz qual parte do prédio você está identificando.</p><p>Assim, fica mais fácil entender rapidamente onde uma pessoa mora.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "18e621e2-72f6-4a5c-9075-cafa5e1d7740",
      "title": "Escute a frase e note como o terceiro andar aparece em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "25b3b955-d3c0-41f4-840b-3da5d433fb70",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o foco vai para o terceiro andar.</p><p><strong>Mi tía vive en el tercer piso.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Minha tia mora no terceiro andar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b5ef9ae2667840879000dced2f89c3de_edificio-tres-pisos.png?Expires=1794099505&Signature=1xToM3SyV4CdJK2O0lKItFNWJpJYbaQst8-ya8UMXzkrKp0gadCE~zQL~ap-JIre6PFPdB0AhPOr9e7mxvEddbvPXkC3GLEbOc39xKwKz5Rtnud5AdnLTWayXe3ChFE3xYpqqormwRzc-bGURV9csZni61Zq8Lgj3e8zbH33pTpK12Ksi35nSnttV5Tz2qn0BunDllnuuk8VL-bg1bNWB9-tJ76J-9CF~dfdofKHaM3FrEo5t0GbdNcmPdy3v5hlmuT8~RJMe8P9BXYULJe2D4sKplWAHCGFJjyPFUPcAXOj2nng7QwfTUGXaVt5X5Pm7VkqK2Uh6UBhKm4lHzsltA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6743fe3debd842c890127a065adb5780_mi-tia-vive-en-el-tercer-piso.mp3?Expires=1794099505&Signature=b9GVyyfI-J5Tt6YmnU7jBGMZkhDUfgeVenkjaaD8IEOS7EQsjnIK2mMFigLAeOD6kB4STMYaefNpz45y37JGbVfG3dkgHcSAR~K~iwrZZ9Zz5VFdJPZo73ZFJytH2YKG625AClNJg4nw5TckQZNu2n3oCJI5eV4towvEI8~udmEEPGzsrPdH7BJod5yS2M-f33G18RjbyqSlCR5f-P6DUpqsQz9IdvaKYCA5LxqBGBRBQGYSPhByy4C7ANoPE85gv8EiaF7NmixImovH-mvJlG~VjZKCXwjXwPZwcNpR2WkAGik~4-3RsARC3MquEuz2YNuPZ4P83gtrMRp3jm1OXw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
